@startuml SD-26-form-or-change-crew
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam ActorBorderColor black
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBorderColor black
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBorderColor black
skinparam EntityBackgroundColor white
skinparam EntityBorderColor black
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor black
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor black
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor white
skinparam SequenceReferenceBackgroundColor white
skinparam SequenceReferenceBorderColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam dpi 150
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 240
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontSize 12
skinparam sequenceActorFontSize 12
autonumber
title SD-26: Form or Change Crew (UC-07)
' Traces: UC-07; FR-30, FR-32, FR-33, FR-44, FR-50, FR-64, FR-66, FR-71.
' Sources: DEC-09, DEC-19, DEC-39, DEC-43, DEC-55, DEC-56; sequence-diagram-review.md.
control ":Roster\nController" as RC
control ":Rule\nValidator" as RV
control ":Notification\nService" as NS
entity ":Crew" as Crew
entity ":Standby" as SB
entity ":Audit Log" as AL

[-> RC ++ : formCrew(proposal)
RC -> RV ++ : checkCrew(proposal)
RV --> RC -- : violations / none
alt blocking violation
  RC -->] : refuse; keep records
else valid
  group atomic Crew save
    alt new Crew
      RC -->> Crew ** : <<create>>(proposal)
      RC -> AL : record(Manager, Crew created)
    else change existing Crew
      RC -> Crew : changeMembers(members)
      RC -> AL : record(Manager, Crew changed)
    end
    opt member was Standby that day
      RC -> SB : endPlacement()
    end
  end
  opt week already Published
    RC -> NS : notify(\nCrew changed,\nremoved and added Staff)
    ref over NS : SD-15
    NS --> RC : delivery recorded
  end
  RC -->] : Crew saved
end
deactivate RC
legend bottom
Completed-work credit is preserved. Crew validation covers all worked Slots and Job Brands.
Draft notification waits for publication; Published changes notify immediately.
Changes and audit commit atomically; failed save retains previous records (NFR-09).
endlegend
@enduml
